  rules exercised: ['add0', 'addI', 'commA', 'commM', 'dist', 'fold', 'mul0', 'mul1', 'mulI', 'undist']
PASS  every rule of the system is value-preserving at 5 evaluation points   | 10 distinct rules, 0 violations
